# shiv.me

Personal site. Plain static HTML in `htdocs/`, served in dev by a small
Bun server (`dev.ts`) with live reload.

## Dev

    bun run dev          # http://localhost:3000

(or `bun run dev.ts` directly)

## Layout

- `htdocs/`        — the site. Everything here is served as-is.
- `htdocs/cv/`     — résumé / CV.
- `dev.ts`         — dev server + live reload.

## Notes

- No build step. Edit files in `htdocs/` and refresh.
- The old stasis/haml generator was removed; the site is hand-written HTML/CSS now.
